{# The live contest's dress: its faces, the shapes every theme shares, then the theme(s) asked for.
   One stylesheet per theme (assets/styles/quiz_live/themes/<slug>.css) - the room's screen and the
   phone load their contest's only, the gallery every one.

   `page` is set by the contest's own whole-window pages (not the gallery, inside the app shell):
   they declare a dark scheme so that a phone's browser in dark mode - Samsung Internet's, Chrome's
   « thème sombre pour les sites » - leaves them alone instead of darkening them by algorithm,
   avatars and propositions' colours included. The contest stays in its theme whatever the scheme
   (`.ql { color-scheme: light }`). #}
{% if page|default(false) %}
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
{% endif %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/quiz_live/fonts.css') }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/quiz_live/live.css') }}">
{% for slug in slugs %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/quiz_live/themes/' ~ slug ~ '.css') }}">
{% endfor %}
